{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b716bb448b4e377d","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Run comparison view for training and pipeline runs in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tai_signals:\n10\t  change_specificity: 1\n11\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n12\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n13\t  existing_foundation: 1\n14\t  open_questions: 1\n15\t  external_dependency: 1\n16\t  human_process_gates: 0\n17\t  repo_access: 1\n18\t  architecture_claims: 1\n19\timplementation_type: null\n20\tdependencies: []\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 7\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Run comparison view for training and pipeline runs in the Dashboard\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tDelivers a run comparison surface in the Dashboard: users select two or more\n34\ttraining or pipeline runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side,\n35\twith a diff presentation that highlights which parameters and metrics changed\n36\tbetween two selected runs. This replaces the exported-spreadsheet workflow\n37\tdescribed in the strategy's problem statement with an in-platform comparison.\n38\t\n39\t## Scope\n40\t\n41\t- Multi-select of two or more runs from the existing runs list in the\n42\t  Dashboard.\n43\t- A comparison view rendering the parameters and metrics of every selected\n44\t  run side by side.\n45\t- Diff presentation for two selected runs: parameters and metrics that\n46\t  changed between the two runs are highlighted. The strategy states this as\n47\t  the same comparison surface — the diff is a presentation mode of the\n48\t  side-by-side view over the same run data — so it is delivered together\n49\t  with the multi-run comparison rather than as a separate effort.\n50\t- The comparison renders data for both training runs and pipeline runs\n51\t  through the run data interfaces the Dashboard already consumes for its\n52\t  per-run pages. Data Science Pipelines requires no code changes for this\n53\t  (passive component); its correct interaction is validated as an\n54\t  acceptance criterion of this epic.\n55\t\n56\t## Acceptance Criteria\n57\t\n58\t- Given the runs list in the Dashboard, a user can select two or more runs\n59\t  and open a comparison of them.\n60\t- The comparison view displays the parameters and metrics of all selected\n61\t  runs side by side.\n62\t- Given exactly two selected runs, the comparison highlights which\n63\t  parameters and metrics differ between the two runs.\n64\t- The comparison renders correctly for pipeline runs sourced from Data\n65\t  Science Pipelines and for training runs — passive-component validation\n66\t  that run parameters and metrics feed the comparison unchanged through the\n67\t  existing run data interfaces, with no Data Science Pipelines code\n68\t  changes.\n69\t\n70\t## HLR Traceability\n71\t\n72\t- HLR-1 (P0): users can select two or more runs and view their parameters\n73\t  and metrics side by side in the Dashboard.\n74\t- HLR-3 (P1): run diff view highlighting which parameters and metrics\n75\t  changed between two selected runs — bundled with HLR-1 because it is a\n76\t  presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the same run data;\n77\t  a separate epic would build the same surface twice.\n78\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a2d5b1089e0b73b1","agent_id":"a0f0da0279c6cdfce","session_id":"2f8acaed-d2b4-4961-b36e-484262868126","uuid":"543001eb-7c5e-4f63-88fc-3538e32d2a1b","timestamp":"2026-10-26T17:12:28.830Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b716bb448b4e377d","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decompositi